sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Usuario
    participant Router as EmailClient
    participant ImapAdapt as IMAP Backend Adapter

    User->>Router: search_envelopes("from alice and after 2026-01-01")
    Router->>ImapAdapt: search_envelopes(mailbox, SearchEmailsQuery)
    
    Note over ImapAdapt: Traducción del DSL
    Note over ImapAdapt: SearchEmailsQuery.filter →<br/>SearchKey::And(<br/>  SearchKey::From("alice"),<br/>  SearchKey::SentSince(2026-01-02)<br/>)

    ImapAdapt->>ImapAdapt: Detecta si server soporta SORT
    
    alt Servidor soporta RFC 5256 SORT
        ImapAdapt->>ImapAdapt: UID SORT (REVERSE DATE) CHARSET UTF-8 ALL criteria
    else Fallback: Sort local en RAM
        ImapAdapt->>ImapAdapt: UID SEARCH criteria
        ImapAdapt->>ImapAdapt: Ordena UIDs localmente (Vec sort)
    end
    
    ImapAdapt->>ImapAdapt: Pagina slice de UIDs
    ImapAdapt->>ImapAdapt: UID FETCH [uid_slice] (UID FLAGS ENVELOPE)
    ImapAdapt->>ImapAdapt: reorder_envelopes() — restaura orden SORT
    ImapAdapt-->>Router: Vec[Envelope]
    Router-->>User: Tabla de resultados
